      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استشار</span></b> : see 1, first sentence. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also 3,
in two places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استشار النَّاقَةَ</span> <i>He</i> (a stallioncamel) <i>smelt the she-camel and examined her, to
know if she had conceived or not;</i> (K;) as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اشتارها</span></b> . (A'Obeyd, TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <i>It</i> (a man's case
or affair) <i>became manifest.</i> (AZ, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>He put
on,</i> or <i>clad himself with, goodly apparel.</i> (K.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also 1, last sentence, in two places.

